A small web host with the directory conventions mkosi documents: mkosi.extra/ (a site and a
unit), mkosi.skeleton/ (an apt setting the packages install over), mkosi.postinst and
mkosi.finalize.

Upstream: https://github.com/systemd/mkosi/blob/v27.1/mkosi/resources/man/mkosi.1.md (the
          directory conventions), not a tree mkosi ships.
License:  LGPL-2.1-or-later (the documentation it follows); this tree is tundravm's.
Exercises: ExtraTrees= with a unit inside it, SkeletonTrees= beside it at the same target,
          PostInstallationScripts= and FinalizeScripts= from the conventional files, an
          implied package (openssl).
